---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn what the Xychen website is for and how its game information is presented."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container narrow-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>A website built around <span>curiosity.</span></h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Xychen is a creator-led website for exploring games and making useful information easier to find.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="container narrow-content prose">
      <h2>What you can expect</h2>
      <p>The site is intended to bring together game coverage, practical tutorials, tips, discoveries, and updates. Roblox is an important part of its content, but the scope is not limited to a single game.</p>
      <h2>How information is handled</h2>
      <p>Where information comes from an external source, the source should be identified. Time-sensitive details should include relevant dates and be checked before publication.</p>
      <p>Leaks, rumors, and unverified claims must be labeled clearly as <strong>unconfirmed</strong>. They should never be presented as official announcements or established facts.</p>
      <h2>Still being built</h2>
      <p>This is the foundation of the website. Sections and publishing features will be introduced in stages, with accuracy, usability, accessibility, and maintainability treated as requirements.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
